   "role": "depth",
   "steps": [
    {
     "id": "where-it-is-used-1",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "t": "prose",
       "md": "- **Econometrics**: the linear regression model as a first-order approximation to $E[y\\mid x]$ ([Conditional Mean vs Linear Projection](note:conditional-mean-vs-linear-projection)); the delta method for $\\hat\\sigma$ in the [Canonical Model of the Skill Premium](note:canonical-model-of-the-skill-premium).\n- **Inequality / labor**: interpreting log gaps as percentages ([Log Wage Gap](note:log-wage-gap)).\n- **Macro**: log-linearizing models around a steady state."
      }
     ],
